Package: artcatr
Title: Sample Size and Power for an Ordered Categorical Outcome
Version: 0.1.0
Authors: André Moser
Maintainer: André Moser <andre.moser@unibe.ch>
Description: Sample size and power calculations for a two-group randomized
    trial with an ordinal outcome analysed by a
    proportional-odds model. Implements the 'ologit' method of White,
    Marley-Zagar, Morris, Parmar, Royston & Babiker (2023)
    <doi:10.1177/1536867X231161934> in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/dcr-unibe-ch/artcatr, https://dcr-unibe-ch.github.io/artcatr/
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    stats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    Hmisc
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
VignetteBuilder: knitr
